{"unit_id":"MaouXY__dsh-ai-session-title#feature-1","repo":"MaouXY/dsh-ai-session-title","commit":"9ec43d2337c37a170a5ead71cdfc2a184d85b13b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-session-title 的功能「从会话生成标题」：读取当前会话的用户与助手文本，使用会话模型生成并清理标题；触发方式是重命名框中的星标按钮或 /ai-title 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:211-235","index.js:327-384"]}
