{"unit_id":"MaouXY__dsh-ai-session-title#feature-4","repo":"MaouXY/dsh-ai-session-title","commit":"9ec43d2337c37a170a5ead71cdfc2a184d85b13b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-session-title 的功能「限制生成参数」：可设置标题字符上限、输出 token 上限和超时时间；也可成对指定 provider 与 model，否则插件尝试沿用会话路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:48-59","index.js:246-263","index.js:343-360"]}
